WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:02,900
know something

2
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:05,570
The Silkworm King is dead

3
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:07,170
my husband died in

4
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:09,170
In the battle with other ghost kings

5
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:11,770
There are three gangs in the hell room he left behind

6
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,170
They were all his subordinates back then

7
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,970
Those people were obedient when he was here but he is no longer there.

8
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,970
Those people started to make their own plans.

9
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:20,370
Although I am still the nominal leader

10
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:23,370
But this body was injured in that battle

11
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:25,370
Now I only have the strength to please the peak

12
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,170
enough for ordinary people

13
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:28,770
But for those based on this location

14
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,970
far from enough

15
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:32,170
I need money, lots of money

16
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:33,770
Only by returning to the peak

17
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,370
Only then can I suppress those three gangs

18
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:37,170
But this news must be kept secret

19
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:39,570
Otherwise, there will be immediate disaster

20
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:40,970
So you see Mr. Su

21
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,970
A human being who carries top recommendations with him

22
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:47,570
I can create 40 million ghost walls at will without feeling distressed.

23
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:51,250
There must be a wealthy power behind him, Chengyao

24
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:53,610
Either he himself is that force

25
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:55,010
No matter which kind

26
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:56,610
He may have breached the contract

27
00:00:56,610 --> 00:01:00,690
You won't come back to bite me after borrowing money

28
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:02,720
I'm ready for the price

29
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:05,850
Now let’s see if he’s worth driving.
